IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `mlr-core`
IMPORT `mlr3-transfer-of-funds`

-- TESTS for mlr3-transfer-of-funds.l4 (regs 61 to 64).  Every expected value is written here from
-- the text of the regulation named beside it, before the code was run.  A #TRACE is not an
-- assertion, so each carries its outcome in an `-- EXPECT` comment that tracecheck.py reads.

§ `Tests -- regs 61 to 64`

`reg 61 test FCA` MEANS `the Financial Conduct Authority`
`reg 61 test HMRC` MEANS `the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs`

§§ `reg 61 and reg 62`

-- the fields of `reg 62 payment service provider`, in order: a payment service provider; an authorised person;
-- an authorised payment institution; a registered small payment institution; included in the Commissioners' register under reg 54(2);
-- an authorised electronic money institution; a registered small electronic money institution
`reg 61 test a bank that is an authorised person`                  MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 61 test an authorised payment institution not on the Commissioners register` MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 61 test an authorised payment institution on the Commissioners register`     MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`reg 61 test a registered small payment institution not on the Commissioners register` MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`reg 61 test a registered small payment institution on the Commissioners register`     MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`reg 61 test an authorised electronic money institution`           MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`reg 61 test a registered small electronic money institution`      MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`reg 61 test a person that is not a payment service provider`      MEANS `reg 62 payment service provider` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a bank that is an authorised person` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test an authorised payment institution not on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test an authorised payment institution on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a registered small payment institution not on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a registered small payment institution on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test an authorised electronic money institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a registered small electronic money institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a person that is not a payment service provider` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a bank that is an authorised person` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a person that is not a payment service provider` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- reg 61: the two answers gathered into the authority
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the payment service provider` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test FCA`
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the payment service provider` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test HMRC`
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the payment service provider` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a bank that is an authorised person` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test FCA`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a bank that is an authorised person` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test an authorised payment institution not on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test FCA`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test an authorised payment institution not on the Commissioners register` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test an authorised payment institution on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test HMRC`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test an authorised payment institution on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a registered small payment institution not on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test FCA`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a registered small payment institution not on the Commissioners register` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a registered small payment institution on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test HMRC`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a registered small payment institution on the Commissioners register` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test an authorised electronic money institution` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test FCA`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test an authorised electronic money institution` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a registered small electronic money institution` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test FCA`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a registered small electronic money institution` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test HMRC`
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a person that is not a payment service provider` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the provider, read from the provider's own limbs` `reg 61 test a person that is not a payment service provider` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 61 the transfer of funds supervisory authority of the payment service provider` (`reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above`) (`reg 62(2) the Commissioners are the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above` (`reg 62(1) the FCA is the transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` `reg 61 test a money service business that is a payment service provider and none of the above`)) EQUALS JUST `reg 61 test HMRC`

§§ `reg 63`

#ASSERT `reg 63(1) the authority is a transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` (JUST `reg 61 test FCA`) `reg 61 test FCA` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1) the authority is a transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` (JUST `reg 61 test FCA`) `reg 61 test HMRC` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(1) the authority is a transfer of funds supervisory authority for the payment service provider` NOTHING `reg 61 test FCA` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(a) the authority has monitored effectively the payment service providers` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(a) the authority has monitored effectively the payment service providers` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(b) the authority has taken the measures necessary to secure compliance` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(b) the authority has taken the measures necessary to secure compliance` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(c) the authority has taken effective measures to encourage the payment service provider to report breaches` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(c) the authority has taken effective measures to encourage the payment service provider to report breaches` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(d) the authority has taken the steps it considers appropriate to co-operate and co-ordinate` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(d) the authority has taken the steps it considers appropriate to co-operate and co-ordinate` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(d) the authority has taken the steps it considers appropriate to co-operate and co-ordinate` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(1)(d) the authority has taken the steps it considers appropriate to co-operate and co-ordinate` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(2) paragraph (2) applies to the payment service provider` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(2) paragraph (2) applies to the payment service provider` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(2) paragraph (2) applies to the payment service provider` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(2) paragraph (2) applies to the payment service provider` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(3) co-operation may include the sharing of the information` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(3) co-operation may include the sharing of the information` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(5) the authority must inform the NCA` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(5) the authority must inform the NCA` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(5) the authority has informed the NCA as soon as practicable` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(5) the authority has informed the NCA as soon as practicable` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(5) the authority has informed the NCA as soon as practicable` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(5) the authority has informed the NCA as soon as practicable` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(6) the disclosure is not to be taken to breach any restriction on the disclosure of information` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(6) the disclosure is not to be taken to breach any restriction on the disclosure of information` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(7) no civil liability arises in respect of the disclosure on the part of the person who made it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(7) no civil liability arises in respect of the disclosure on the part of the person who made it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(7) no civil liability arises in respect of the disclosure on the part of the person who made it` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(8) the function is treated as a function conferred on the FCA under FSMA for the purposes of section 1A of, and Parts 1, 2 and 4 of Schedule 1ZA to, FSMA` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(8) the function is treated as a function conferred on the FCA under FSMA for the purposes of section 1A of, and Parts 1, 2 and 4 of Schedule 1ZA to, FSMA` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 63(10) the body is an overseas authority` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(10) the body is an overseas authority` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 63(10) the body is an overseas authority` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(10) the body is an overseas authority` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(10) the body is an overseas authority` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 63(10) the body is an overseas authority` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `reg 64`

#ASSERT `reg 64(3) the person is a person specified in this paragraph` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 64(3) the person is a person specified in this paragraph` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 64(3) the person is a person specified in this paragraph` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 64(3) the person is a person specified in this paragraph` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64(2) the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly to the enquiry` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 64(2) the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly to the enquiry` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64(2) the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly to the enquiry` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 64(2) the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly to the enquiry` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 64(2) the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly to the enquiry` NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `The duties as obligations (#TRACE): each prints the outcome in its EXPECT comment`

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `reg 63(1)(a) the authority must monitor effectively the payment service providers (as an obligation)` `reg 61 test FCA` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `reg 61 test FCA` DOES `reg 63(1)(a) monitor effectively the payment service providers` AT 1
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `reg 63(1)(b) the authority must take the measures necessary to secure compliance (as an obligation)` `reg 61 test HMRC` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `reg 61 test HMRC` DOES `reg 63(1)(b) take the measures necessary to secure compliance` AT 1
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `reg 63(1)(c) the authority must take effective measures to encourage reporting of breaches (as an obligation)` `reg 61 test HMRC` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `reg 61 test HMRC` DOES `reg 63(1)(c) take effective measures to encourage the payment service provider to report breaches` AT 1
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `reg 63(1)(d) the authority must take the steps it considers appropriate (as an obligation)` `reg 61 test FCA` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `reg 61 test FCA` DOES `reg 63(1)(d) take such steps as it considers appropriate to co-operate and co-ordinate` AT 1
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `reg 63(5) the authority must inform the NCA (as an obligation)` `reg 61 test FCA` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `reg 61 test FCA` DOES `reg 63(5) inform the NCA` AT 1
